WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.488 --> 00:00:06.888
Yes, it really helps!

2
00:00:07.224 --> 00:00:11.856
The most effective way to communicate your taste to the artist is with an image.

3
00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:17.544
The phrase "make it look natural" means something different to everyone.

4
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:23.928
For some, that means almost no makeup at all; for others, it means just having defined features.

5
00:00:24.264 --> 00:00:29.112
A single reference photo becomes a clear guideline that gets everyone on the same page.

6
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:35.232
There's no need to hesitate just because the model in the photo is a celebrity or has a different face shape than you.

7
00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:39.840
The artist reads the mood and the need behind the image you bring.

8
00:00:40.176 --> 00:00:45.984
Once you can communicate specifics like "I like the bangs in this photo" or "I want the bun placed like this,"

9
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:46.440
the artist can adapt that design in three dimensions to fit your actual face shape and head.

10
00:00:46.776 --> 00:00:53.328
Through this process, you'll often discover your own wedding-parent style with a pleasant surprise: "This actually suits me too?"

11
00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:58.248
Don't hesitate, just bring along any photos you've always found pretty.
